at wraps everything up  perfectly so I could definitely live  with the tournament of power ending in a  tie but let me know what you guys think  which ending is most likely and would  you be ok if the tournament ended as a  tie or as a result of the time running  out or do you want to see someone emerge  as the decisive winner let me know down  in the comments if you enjoy the Dragon  Ball super  on this channel I want to see more be  sure to leave a like to let me know if  you are new to the channel don't forget  to subscribe and hit that notification  bell if you have some draggable super  fan art that you want to share with us  and have it potentially featured in a  future video be sure to follow us on  twitter and instagram at anime uproar  and if you want to discuss anime  theories recommendations and a lot more  you can join our discord server link in  the description as always thank you all  so much for watching and until next time  see us space cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]

